xnu: MERLIN 0120 kernel boot screen (Apple mark + real progress bar)

Nothing in XNU or the iOS userland ever redraws the ABL/LK splash left in
cont_splash_region, so the phone shows the bootloader picture (and the text
console painted over it) for the whole boot: the progress bar that is there
is part of the static splash and can never move.

This adds a real renderer, iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetBootUI.cpp:

  - the Apple mark is a vector outline (SweetBootLogo.h, generated by
    tools/gen-boot-logo.py from the Font Awesome 6 "apple" brand icon)
    rasterised at runtime with 4x4 supersampling to the panel geometry;
  - the progress bar is drawn from real boot milestones, never a timer:
    5 = framebuffer mapped (AppleCLCD::start), 25 = root mounted
    (bsd_init.c), 45 = launchd exec, 65 = backboardd exec, 85 =
    SpringBoard exec (kern_exec.c), 100 = first non-blank composited
    frame (AppleCLCD::present sampling), after which drawing stops;
  - progress is monotonic and capped at 85 until real UI pixels arrive,
    so an unreachable milestone leaves the bar where it is instead of
    pretending the boot completed;
  - the panel is cleared to black once, then the mark/bar are redrawn on
    top of the compositor every presented frame; a panic is never painted
    over; the on-screen text console is muted (it still reaches the log).

Also flips the display geometry default: AppleCLCD now presents the real
panel (1080x2340 on merlin) and the synthetic iPhone X profile
(1125x2436 = 375x812 pt @3x) becomes an explicit opt-in,
sweetfb_iphonex=1.  With the synthetic profile UIKit looks for
BoundingPathBitmap-1125x2436-375x812-3.00x, which this device tree does not
ship, and SpringBoard aborts on every launch with
NSInternalInconsistencyException (0119 log: 49 SpringBoard execs, 49 crashes).

Boot args: sweetbootui=0 disables the boot screen,
sweetbootui_noconsole=1 keeps the text console visible.

Files:
  iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetBootUI.{cpp,h}   new renderer (C++/IOKit)
  iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetBootLogo.h       generated outline
  iokit/conf/files.arm64                 build it
  iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp  start + redraw + frame feedback,
                                         native geometry default
  bsd/kern/bsd_init.c                    root-mount milestone
  bsd/kern/kern_exec.c                   launchd/backboardd/SpringBoard
                                         milestones
